//! Lexer, parser and evaluator cases for the Python expression syntax beyond the
//! basic operators: slices, numeric and string literal forms, escapes, f-strings,
//! `is`, method calls and attributes on scalars, `@`, lambdas, starred elements.
//!
//! Generated by `tests/differential/expr/gen_syntax_tests.py` from
//! `tests/differential/expr/corpus/syntax.jsonl`: each case is an expression with
//! the bindings below and the result upstream `linkml-map` v0.6.0-rc1 produced for
//! it (`eval_expr_with_mapping`, simpleeval): `{"ok": v}` or `{"err": "<exception>"}`
//! (floats as `{"$f": "<hex of the IEEE-754 bits>"}`). The whole probe set, with
//! statement blocks, is replayed by `cargo test -p linkml-map-conformance --test
//! expr_differential`.

